/*
 * music-backend-config.h.example - Template for the Music project's
 * private Supabase project ref
 *
 * Copy this file to music-backend-config.h (which is gitignored) and
 * fill in the real values.
 *
 * MUSIC_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID is used two ways:
 *   1. The dock's injected JS (music-auth-script.h) watches Supabase's
 *      own localStorage session key, named
 *      "sb-<project-ref>-auth-token" — without the real project ref
 *      here, it will never find a session to read a user ID from.
 *   2. MusicManager polls the project's REST API directly with this
 *      project's anon key.
 *
 * MUSIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY only needs read access — overlay_data has a
 * public SELECT policy (the same one the web overlay itself relies on
 * for unauthenticated OBS browser sources), so no user access/refresh
 * token is ever needed here. Only the bare user ID is captured from
 * the dock (see music-auth-script.h) to scope the query.
 *
